    "updated_at": "2015-09-02T20:56:13Z",
    "body": "Nah, this PR is pretty wrong, or at least very incomplete.\n\nFor a non-Bikeshedded spec to present `<dfn>s` in a way that Shepherd understands, follow [this guide](https://github.com/tabatkins/bikeshed/blob/master/docs/dfn-contract.md).\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "reactions": {
